##REQUIREMENTS
#PyTorch Version: 2.0.0+cu118
#torchvision Version: 0.15.0+cu118
#CUDA Available: True 


You can download the YOLOv5 repository as a ZIP file directly from GitHub:
Go to the YOLOv5 GitHub page.
Click on the green Code button.
Select Download ZIP.
After downloading, extract the ZIP file to your desired directory and continue with your work.



##STEPS:
1. Set up pyth0n environment
2. Prepare dataset
3. Train YOLOv5 model
4. Monitor training
5. Evaluate and test your model
6. Fine-tune




